;; spec:   stdlib §4.4 (row repeat: an infinite source), §2.7 (three printers), §14 D7 of the tranche 2 plan (no Debug for an endless source)
;; expect: reject
;; error:  no implementation of Debug for (Repeat
;; roots:  ../../lib support
;; covers: pr-str
;; The same refusal for `Repeat` and the Debug text: `(pr-str (repeat 1))` would be the text of an endless
;; seq, so there is no `Debug (Repeat a)`, and the error names the type. D7 is **Proposed (plan
;; recommendation, owner not yet confirmed)**. `(pr-str (take 2 (repeat 1)))` is `(1 1)` (case 2972).
(ns main)

(defun main () -> i64 (str-len (pr-str (repeat 1))))
